{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Appease your Otter god with a feast of tasty zombies\u2026 or suffer the hellish consequences!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Use  anything as a weapon, yes, even your friends!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623280/extras/Use_Anything_As_A_Weapon.gif?t=1746191304\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a wild mix of expected and totally unexpected weapons at The Wet Plank Tavern. Grab whatever you can find and see what chaos it brings!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Proximity chat chaos!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623280/extras/Proximity_Chat.gif?t=1746191304\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Proximity chat cranks up the chaos! Throw your friends around (in-game) and hear what happens. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Mayhem at The Wet Plank Tavern!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623280/extras/Mayhem_at_The_Wet_Plank_Tavern!.gif?t=1746191304\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zombies have invaded the tavern, the Otter god is hungry, and your friends are acting as dumb and useless as ever. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Bow before your Otter god!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623280/extras/Ottergod.gif?t=1746191304\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beat up those pesky zombies and serve them up to your all-powerful overlord! It's a fight for survival, will it be the zombies or the vampirates that reign supreme?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Become the vampirate your mother always wanted you to be!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623280/extras/Mother.gif?t=1746191304\" 